{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-start-strategies","title":"冷启动策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/operations/cold-start-strategies","wordCount":2058,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"冷启动策略\">冷启动策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户冷启动</td>\n<td>新注册用户没有历史行为，无法做个性化推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品冷启动</td>\n<td>新上架商品没有交互数据，无法进入协同过滤召回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场景冷启动</td>\n<td>新开辟的推荐场景没有历史数据积累</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册引导</td>\n<td>通过新手流程收集用户偏好的显式信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移学习</td>\n<td>将其他数据源的知识迁移到冷启动场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元学习</td>\n<td>训练能快速适应新用户/新商品的元模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[冷启动问题] --&gt; B[用户冷启动]&#10;    A --&gt; C[商品冷启动]&#10;    A --&gt; D[场景冷启动]&#10;    B --&gt; E[注册引导]&#10;    B --&gt; F[人口统计迁移]&#10;    B --&gt; G[快速学习]&#10;    C --&gt; H[内容嵌入]&#10;    C --&gt; I[热启动策略]&#10;    C --&gt; J[元学习]&#10;    D --&gt; K[热启动借鉴]&#10;    D --&gt; L[渐进式积累]\">graph TD\n    A[冷启动问题] --&gt; B[用户冷启动]\n    A --&gt; C[商品冷启动]\n    A --&gt; D[场景冷启动]\n    B --&gt; E[注册引导]\n    B --&gt; F[人口统计迁移]\n    B --&gt; G[快速学习]\n    C --&gt; H[内容嵌入]\n    C --&gt; I[热启动策略]\n    C --&gt; J[元学习]\n    D --&gt; K[热启动借鉴]\n    D --&gt; L[渐进式积累]</pre><p>冷启动是推荐系统无法回避的工程挑战，在三个维度同时存在：新用户没有历史行为（用户冷启动）、新商品没有交互数据（商品冷启动）、新推荐场景没有历史数据积累（场景冷启动）。冷启动问题的根本原因是推荐算法的&quot;越用越准&quot;特性与&quot;需要有数据才能用&quot;之间的鸡蛋-鸡矛盾。有效的冷启动策略能显著改善新用户留存率和新商品的增长速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户冷启动\">用户冷启动</h2><h3 id=\"定义冷启动阶段\">定义冷启动阶段</h3><p>用户冷启动不是二值状态（是/否冷启动），而是一个连续过渡过程。通常定义为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>极冷启动</strong>：注册后无任何行为（0-1次）</li>\n<li><strong>冷启动</strong>：行为极少，模型无法可靠建模（1-10次交互）</li>\n<li><strong>温启动</strong>：有一定行为但数据仍不充分（10-100次交互）</li>\n<li><strong>成熟用户</strong>：充足历史数据，协同过滤可靠工作（100+次交互）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不同阶段适用不同的推荐策略，并设置触发切换的阈值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"注册引导-onboarding\">注册引导（Onboarding）</h3><p>在用户注册后立即通过引导流程收集偏好信息，是最直接的冷启动解决方案。</p>\n<p><strong>设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>低摩擦</strong>：问题尽量少（不超过3步），每步选择直观（图片展示而非文字）</li>\n<li><strong>即时价值</strong>：每步选择后立即展示相应的个性化内容，让用户感受到回答问题的价值</li>\n<li><strong>可跳过</strong>：不强制填写，降低流失率，对跳过用户使用降级策略</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"引导流程示例：&#10;Step 1: &quot;您最感兴趣的品类是？&quot;（多选，带图片，最多选5个）&#10;Step 2: &quot;您的预算范围通常是？&quot;（价格区间选择）&#10;Step 3: &quot;为您推荐了 X 款商品，这些是否符合您的口味？&quot;&#10;         → 用户反应（快速点击/滑走）作为行为反馈\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>引导流程示例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 1: \"您最感兴趣的品类是？\"（多选，带图片，最多选5个）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 2: \"您的预算范围通常是？\"（价格区间选择）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 3: \"为您推荐了 X 款商品，这些是否符合您的口味？\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         → 用户反应（快速点击/滑走）作为行为反馈</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>引导数据的局限性</strong>：用户的声称偏好（stated preference）和实际行为偏好（revealed preference）往往存在差距。用户可能在引导中选择&quot;国际大牌&quot;，但实际行为上更多购买性价比国货。引导数据作为初始先验，随着行为数据积累逐渐降低权重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"人口统计相似用户迁移\">人口统计相似用户迁移</h3><p>在没有个人行为数据时，用相似群体的偏好作为个人偏好的估计：</p>\n<p><strong>相似度维度</strong>：注册手机号归属地（推断城市）、注册设备型号（推断消费能力）、注册时间（推断特定促销活动吸引来的用户群）、邀请来源（推断关系网络属性）。</p>\n<p><strong>偏好迁移方法</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>根据上述维度将用户归类到预定义的细分群体（如&quot;一线城市iPhone用户&quot;）</li>\n<li>以该细分群体的历史行为聚合偏好作为新用户的初始个性化偏好</li>\n<li>随着个人行为数据积累，逐步用个人偏好替代群体偏好</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ColdStartRecommender:&#10;    def recommend(self, user: User) -&gt; List[Item]:&#10;        if user.interaction_count == 0:&#10;            # 纯冷启动：使用群体偏好&#10;            segment = self.get_user_segment(user)&#10;            return self.segment_recommender.recommend(segment)&#10;        elif user.interaction_count &lt; 10:&#10;            # 过渡阶段：混合个人行为和群体偏好&#10;            alpha = user.interaction_count / 10&#10;            personal = self.personal_recommender.recommend(user)&#10;            segment = self.segment_recommender.recommend(&#10;                self.get_user_segment(user)&#10;            )&#10;            return self.blend(personal, segment, alpha=alpha)&#10;        else:&#10;            # 成熟用户：纯个人化推荐&#10;            return self.personal_recommender.recommend(user)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ColdStartRecommender</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recommend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, user: User) -> List[Item]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.interaction_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 纯冷启动：使用群体偏好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            segment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.get_user_segment(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.segment_recommender.recommend(segment)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.interaction_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 过渡阶段：混合个人行为和群体偏好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.interaction_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            personal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.personal_recommender.recommend(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            segment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.segment_recommender.recommend(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.get_user_segment(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.blend(personal, segment, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">alpha)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 成熟用户：纯个人化推荐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.personal_recommender.recommend(user)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"快速学习-fast-adaptation\">快速学习（Fast Adaptation）</h3><p>新用户的每一次行为都是高价值的信号，需要比成熟用户更快地更新推荐策略：</p>\n<p><strong>实时反馈循环</strong>：新用户的任何行为（点击/浏览/加购）立即触发推荐策略更新，无需等待离线模型重训。通过在线 Bandit 算法（Thompson Sampling）实现实时的个性化调整。</p>\n<p><strong>MAML（Model-Agnostic Meta-Learning）</strong>：训练一个&quot;能快速学习的模型&quot;——经过少量梯度更新就能适应新用户的元模型。训练时模拟大量&quot;从0到N次交互的适应过程&quot;，让模型学会快速学习：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">U</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_\\theta \\sum_{u \\in \\mathcal{U}_{train}} \\mathcal{L}_u(\\theta - \\alpha \\nabla_\\theta \\mathcal{L}_u(\\mathcal{D}_u^{support}; \\theta))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4444em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0993em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0936em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"商品冷启动\">商品冷启动</h2><h3 id=\"内容嵌入直接上线\">内容嵌入直接上线</h3><p>新商品入库时，即使没有任何用户交互数据，也可以通过内容嵌入（商品标题、图片、属性）生成内容向量，立即参与基于内容相似度的召回：</p>\n<p><strong>与已有商品的相似度</strong>：新商品的内容嵌入与库中已有商品进行相似度比较，插入相关&quot;猜你喜欢&quot;场景（&quot;看了又看&quot;）。</p>\n<p><strong>新商品的位置偏置消除</strong>：新商品因为没有 CTR 历史数据，如果直接与成熟商品竞争，会因为估计的 CTR 偏低而无法获得曝光机会。需要为新商品维护独立的置信区间，用 UCB 或 Thompson Sampling 保障其探索性曝光机会。</p>\n<h3 id=\"热启动-warm-up-策略\">热启动（Warm Up）策略</h3><p><strong>相似商品的历史数据迁移</strong>：找到与新商品内容最相似的已有商品，将其用户交互数据作为新商品的初始先验：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>similar</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\mu}_{new} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{similar}(new)} w_i \\cdot \\hat{\\mu}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">similar</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 与新商品的相似度决定，相似商品越多、相关数据越充足，热启动效果越好。</p>\n<p><strong>共购关系迁移</strong>：新商品属于某个品类，可以从同品类商品的共购数据中推断新商品的潜在搭配关系，立即参与&quot;一起购买&quot;推荐。</p>\n<h3 id=\"商品曝光计划-listing-promotion\">商品曝光计划（Listing Promotion）</h3><p>运营层面为新商品设计系统性的曝光计划：</p>\n<p><strong>阶段性曝光目标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第1周：获得最低限度的曝光（至少N次展示，收集初始 CTR 数据）</li>\n<li>第2-4周：根据初始 CTR 数据评估商品质量，决定是否继续加大曝光</li>\n<li>第4周后：商品已有足够数据进入正常的个性化竞争</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>商品质量加速评估</strong>：在初始曝光阶段，选择对该品类高度感兴趣的用户群体（提高有效曝光率），并重点监控 CTR、加购率、购买率和退货率，更快地积累高质量的反馈信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景冷启动\">场景冷启动</h2><p>新开辟的推荐场景（如新推出的&quot;直播间商品推荐&quot;）没有专有的历史数据，需要从相关场景借鉴：</p>\n<p><strong>迁移学习</strong>：将成熟场景（首页推荐）的模型参数作为新场景的初始化起点，再用新场景的少量数据进行 Fine-tune。</p>\n<p><strong>多场景联合训练</strong>：同时在多个场景数据上训练模型，让模型学习跨场景通用的用户偏好表征，新场景只需少量数据就能激活。</p>\n<p><strong>渐进式数据积累</strong>：新场景初期数据少，适当降低模型复杂度（避免过拟合），随数据增加逐步提升模型容量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷启动的系统性度量\">冷启动的系统性度量</h2><p>冷启动效果的评估指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新用户7天留存率</td>\n<td>注册后7天内有回访的新用户比例</td>\n<td>最大化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新用户首购率</td>\n<td>注册后N天内完成首购的用户比例</td>\n<td>最大化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次推荐相关性</td>\n<td>新用户看到首屏推荐的 CTR</td>\n<td>与成熟用户差距最小化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新商品曝光达标率</td>\n<td>新商品第N天内获得目标曝光量的比例</td>\n<td>最大化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动-成熟转化速度</td>\n<td>用户从冷启动到&quot;成熟用户&quot;所需的平均天数</td>\n<td>最小化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>冷启动问题在用户、商品、场景三个维度同时存在，需要针对性的解决方案。用户冷启动通过注册引导收集显式偏好、通过人口统计迁移利用群体智慧、通过快速学习（MAML/在线 Bandit）实现急速个性化适应。商品冷启动通过内容嵌入保证新品立即可推荐、通过热启动迁移相似商品数据、通过系统性曝光计划加速数据积累。场景冷启动通过迁移学习和多场景联合训练实现快速启动。冷启动效果的持续监控（新用户留存率、首购率、冷启动转化速度）是评估策略有效性的客观依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冷启动策略","id":"冷启动策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用户冷启动","id":"用户冷启动"},{"level":3,"text":"定义冷启动阶段","id":"定义冷启动阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"注册引导（Onboarding）","id":"注册引导-onboarding"},{"level":3,"text":"人口统计相似用户迁移","id":"人口统计相似用户迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"快速学习（Fast Adaptation）","id":"快速学习-fast-adaptation"},{"level":2,"text":"商品冷启动","id":"商品冷启动"},{"level":3,"text":"内容嵌入直接上线","id":"内容嵌入直接上线"},{"level":3,"text":"热启动（Warm Up）策略","id":"热启动-warm-up-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"商品曝光计划（Listing Promotion）","id":"商品曝光计划-listing-promotion"},{"level":2,"text":"场景冷启动","id":"场景冷启动"},{"level":2,"text":"冷启动的系统性度量","id":"冷启动的系统性度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"探索与利用策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/operations/exploration-exploitation"},"next":{"title":"个性化指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/operations/personalization-metrics"}}